  "description": "20” 750w Folding E-Bike – Rugged Power, Ultimate Comfort, and Versatility with 750W Motor & Full Suspension!\nThe Kama 2.0 seamlessly blends rugged capabilities, exceptional comfort, and affordable cost. With 20” fat tires and a potent 750W motor, our electric bike is perfect for off-road adventures, weekend spins around the city, and travel commutes. The electric bike for adults with full suspensions helps to smooth out trails and gives you more control over rough terrain.\n\nSADDLE\nExtra soft anti-compression foam with leather cover.\n\nSENSOR\nSpeed and Torque Integrated intelligent Pedals Assisted System\n\nEXTRAS\nThis Lithium Battery 20 Inch Electric Folding Fat Bike is powered by 48V/13Ah Li-ion battery which can be charged in 4-6 hours. It is constructed with aluminum alloy 6061. It can be folded for easy storage and transport. Equipped with 750W light weight high speed brushless rear wheel hub motor (EU), it can achieve a maximum speed of 20mile/h with a travel range of 20-25mile. It has an intelligent Pedals Assisted System which makes it like a normal bike and provides a natural riding experience.\n\nWEIGHT\n\n98cmx50cmx78cm 88.2lb",
